  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/uURVp8x.png\" alt=\"无赖之需 - Simply Swords 扩展包\" width=\"1152\" height=\"648\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/tTghqaB.png\" alt=\"新增超过520种武器，包含专属特效。全面支持Better Combat模组。\" width=\"1152\" height=\"648\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/GMJNUUb.png\" alt=\"需要Simply Swords模组\" width=\"1152\" height=\"156\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9eovfuJ.png\" alt=\"需要Architectury API\" width=\"1152\" height=\"156\"></a></strong></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/btBnBWk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1152\" height=\"156\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><em>\"每个无赖都需要的装备。\" ——史蒂夫·我的世界</em></span></p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>必需模组</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Swords</a>（必须安装）[FORGE/FABRIC - 1.18 → 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a>&nbsp;[FORGE/FABRIC - 1.18 → 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">ClothConfig</span></strong></a> [FORGE/FABRIC - 1.18 → 1.20]</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>可选 - 兼容模组</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Better</span> Combat</a>&nbsp;<strong>（强烈推荐）&nbsp;</strong>[FORGE/FABRIC - 1.18 → 1.20]</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forbidden &amp;</a></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Arcanus</a>&nbsp;[FORGE - 1.18 → 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮色森林</a> [FORGE/FABRIC - 1.18 → 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">地下花园</a> [FORGE - 1.18 → 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">蓝色天空</a>&nbsp;[FORGE - 1.18 → 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plus-the-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plus The End</a>&nbsp;[FORGE - 1.18]&nbsp;</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的末地</a>&nbsp;[FABRIC - 1.18 → 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的下界</a>&nbsp;[FABRIC - 1.18 → 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mariums-soulslike-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Marium的魂系武器库</a>&nbsp;[FABRIC - 1.18 → 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">更深更暗</a> [FORGE/FABRIC - 1.19]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" rel=\"nofollow\">你将去的生物群系</a> [FORGE/FABRIC - 1.18 → 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-imbuement\" rel=\"nofollow\">紫水晶灌注</a> [FABRIC 1.20]</li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:10px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">-Oh The Biomes You'll Go Refabricated</a> 适用于Fabric版本</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>问题反馈</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>我会修复的问题：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>火焰武器目前没有动画效果</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>超出我能力范围的问题：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>修复基础模组的次要双持问题（如地下花园、蓝色天空等）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;这需要修改对应模组的源代码</p>\n&nbsp;</div><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>常见问题</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>问：会支持X模组吗？</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 答：</strong>可能会，欢迎在评论区提出支持请求。但无法保证一定实现</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>问：在哪里报告问题或提出建议？</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>答：</strong>这里就是最理想的反馈位置</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;致谢名单</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>本模组的诞生离不开以下杰出人士的帮助与支持：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Konsyliarz42</strong> - <em>创作了作为纹理基础与参考的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimply-swords-vanilla-style\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Swords - 原版风格</a>资源包</em></li>\n<li><strong>Sweenuss/Sweeney</strong> - <em>Simply Swords的创作者，没有他们的支持就不会有这个模组</em></li>\n<li><strong>Chronos_Sacaria</strong> - Timefall Development联合创始人（负责<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdw\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCDW</a>等模组），在代码重写方面提供了巨大帮助</li>\n<li><strong>Daedelus</strong> - <em>Better Combat创作者，协助添加了对其模组的支持（他们非常棒，请给他们一块饼干）</em></li>\n<li><strong>LostLandFound</strong> - <em>美术师、测试员兼好友。本模组的存在归功于他们为适配Konsyliarz纹理付出的辛勤工作</em></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/fzzyhmstrs/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">fzzyhmstrs</a>&nbsp;</strong>- 社区杰出成员<em>（请关注他们的作品）</em></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/phantomprogrammer/\" rel=\"nofollow\">PhantomProgrammer</a> - 美术师。制作了\"你将去的生物群系\"和\"更深更暗\"兼容纹理</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>免责声明</strong> - <em>虽然本模组是Simply Swords的扩展包，但并未与Simply Swords或Timefall Development建立官方关联。我不主张对Simply Swords原始内容的任何所有权。本模组中所有纹理与模型均为独立创作内容</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
